{
  "title": "Change Email: Let Users Update Their Email Address | Orchard Core",
  "description": "By default, the Email field on the edit page of an existing user can't be edited, so a user has no way to change the email address of their own account.\n\nThe Users Change Email feature adds a Change Email item to the user menu and a page where a signed-in user enters a different address. This video enables the feature, turns on its setting, and follows a user through the change.\n\nIn this video:\n• What the feature adds\n• Enable the feature\n• Turn on the setting\n• Change an email address\n• What the page checks\n• Summary",
